BAIZONN is a start-up, formed in belief that it will be able to transform the manner in which people and all other things geo-locate and tag each other in an all terrain and connected society anywhere anytime BAIZONN is helmed by passionate professionals, whose roots from the Defence Technology Ecosystem and whose expertise include:
a) High Precision Real-time Localisation Systems (RTLS);
b) Advanced Digital Communications Systems Wireless Network Modelling & Analysis;
c) Application-specific Software customisation & development; and
d) Complex project management execution and delivery.
BAIZONN seeks to find good business value proposition in its RTLS technologies and solutions. Our mission is to be a business & technology leader in RTLS solutions and services in Asia Pac and beyond. We focus on both defence , homeland security and customized solutions for Indoor positioning and tracking that will drive the following echelons of capability in
a) all terrain C4I Blue Force Tracking (BFT);
b) Battlefield Instrumentation (BFI);
c) Assets Tracking for Combat Service Support (CSS);
d) Urban Operations (Indoor-GPS);
e) Unmanned Ground Vehicle Navigation;
f) Logistics High Value Assets; and
g) 6 D.O.F. Navigation.
Our expertise comprises following domain:
a) Localisation algorithm development (UWB, MIMO);
b) RF/Baseband design and development (2GHz & above);
c) Integrated indoor/outdoor location-based services;
d) Software Modelling & Analysis (OPNET, Matlab, C++, QualNet); and
e) Environmental Channel Modelling & Estimation.

